Gauge market sentiment by aggregating a variety of sentiment indicators like the VIX, Put/Call ratio, and CNN Fear and Greed Index, and also compare the S&P500 opening price on Monday to its current price. If the S&P500 is higher now than the Monday opening, then boost your optimism score. If all indicators suggest fear or uncertainty, moderately reduce sentiment, but maintain a slightly optimistic bias. Conviction is determined by the consistency across these indicators, with a maximum achievable conviction regardless of indicator agreement, to simulate a contrarian view.